OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies hope Southport Inquiry
OL,4,Awill bring 'meaningful' change
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe second part of the inquiry, which
OL,7,Fwill be held at the International
OL,8,FDisputes Resolution Centre in London,
OL,9,Fis expected to look at broader issues
OL,10,Fon how to deal with individuals who
OL,11,Fpose a risk of extreme violence
